SUMMARY:Music Friday in Lancaster City
DESCRIPTION:On the third Friday of the month\, Lancaster City celebrates Music Friday in honor of our live music scene filled with local bands\, musicians\, and singer-songwriters. \nThe Lancaster Office of Promotion and Music for Everyone host the “Music Friday Series” from May to September. \nEvent Calendar for Lancaster\, PA »\n(click here) \n\nCheck below for a calendar of the upcoming Friday events:\n\nFirst Fridays in Lancaster City\nFirst Friday in Mt. Gretna\nFirst Saturday in Ephrata\nThird Fridays are Music Fridays in Lancaster\nFourth Friday in Mount Joy\nFourth Saturday in Columbia\n\nSee our monthly Calendar of Friday Events for descriptions of each. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
