SUMMARY:Baby Animal Festival at Corn Cob Acres
DESCRIPTION:Spring’s cutest event is back and we are excited to host our 4th Annual Baby Animal Festival! Come meet and pet the newest additions to our farm—these little ones are ready to steal your heart. You will get to see our resident goats along with the newest additions to our farm\, Cocoa the miniature horse and Buttons and Beans our adorable miniature donkeys. Cheerio the baby alpaca will be back along with the crowd favorite Highland Cows. There will be pigs\, bunnies\, chicks\, ducks\, lambs\, and many other special animal guests too many to mention. \nNEW for 2026! We will be debuting our newest addition to the park\, Cornelius Quest – A Magical Scavenger Hunt. Guests will embark on a self-guided adventure using their special wand to unlock magical secrets hidden throughout the park. This activity is open to everyone (wands must be purchased separately). \nAlong with all of the exciting animals\, all of the 40+ activities that are generally found at Corn Cob Acres will be open for all-day play! Click here to see the list of all of our activities. Due to the time of year\, the only activities that will not be open will be the Cornfield Trail\, Pumpkin Painting\, and Pig Races. \nAside from the animals and activities\, there will be additional entertainment throughout the park. We will have delicious food from our vendors along with sweet treats and drinks. \nOur Baby Animal Festival will be a day to remember for the entire family. We look forward to seeing you soon! \n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/baby-animal-festival-corn-cob-acres/
