SUMMARY:Marietta Day
DESCRIPTION:Marietta Day is a beloved annual tradition that transforms seven blocks of Market Street into a vibrant\, pedestrian-only Community Yard Sale and Street Fair. Held in the historic borough of Marietta\, this eclectic event invites visitors to stroll through a treasure hunter’s paradise where local residents sell flea market finds alongside professional artisans and crafters. \nBeyond the shopping\, the atmosphere is fueled by a variety of food trucks and community fellowship. Whether you’re hunting for a unique antique or enjoying a day out with neighbors\, Marietta Day perfectly captures the town’s small-town charm and spirit. \n\nSee our schedule of Fairs & Festivals in Lancaster County and surrounding areas.\nOther Things To Do in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nFactory Tours\n\n\n\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
