SUMMARY:Baron Brew Fest
DESCRIPTION:The 4th annual Baron Brew Fest will be held on Saturday\, May 16\, 2026\,\nfrom 3:00-6:00 pm in Market Square\, Manheim\, PA!\n  \nThis event will celebrate and showcase samples of a variety of different products (beer\, wine\, cider\, mead and spirits) from makers around the region. Held outdoors\, in our beautiful Market Square\, we’ll also feature live music and food vendors. In addition to enjoying samples from our vendors\, you have the opportunity to purchase many of those products (bottles\, cans\, growlers\, six packs\, etc) to enjoy at home. Don’t want to carry those around with you all afternoon? No problem! Ticket holders can use our convenient “bottle check” to pick up your purchases on your way out. \n\nOther Things To Do in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nBreweries\n\n\n\nFactory Tours\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
